&lt;li&gt;OpenSSL 3.2.1 (&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.openssl.org/source/apache-license-2.0.txt&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
